{"date":"2014-08-22","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/71/ec/124649_c10FQ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/71/ec/124649_c10FQ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/71/ec/124649_c10FQ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/71/ec/124649_c10FQ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/71/ec/124649_c10FQ.jpg"},"summary":"本剧的世界设定是普通人类和拟人化的动物共同生活在一起，除了外形，这些动物跟人类没什么不同。马男波杰克（威尔·阿奈特 Will Arnett 配音）就是一匹中年过气明星马，他年轻时主演的电视剧《胡闹的小马》风靡一时，而今他已是无人问津的过气明星，与人类废柴陶德（亚伦·保尔 Aaron Paul 配音）一同生活在LA的一所别墅里。为了重整旗鼓，波杰克在经纪人兼前女友卡罗琳公主（艾米·塞德丽丝 Amy Sedaris 配音）催促下决定出版一部自传，希望回到大众视野里。但是由于波杰克过分拖延迟迟不肯下笔，出版社介绍了一位枪手作者戴安（爱丽森·布里 Alison Brie 配音）给他。波杰克多番拒绝，终于，在一个派对上，他与戴安相遇了，却发现她竟是自己的死对头花生酱先生的女朋友。","name":"Bojack Horseman","name_cn":"马男波杰克","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":193,"total_count":86183},{"name":"Netflix","count":136,"total_count":22395},{"name":"TV","count":107,"total_count":1391083},{"name":"致郁","count":96,"total_count":23282},{"name":"2014","count":89,"total_count":70753},{"name":"美国","count":80,"total_count":26991},{"name":"毒鸡汤","count":77,"total_count":177},{"name":"原创","count":71,"total_count":614204},{"name":"搞笑","count":51,"total_count":632705},{"name":"美漫","count":47,"total_count":1981},{"name":"美国动画","count":43,"total_count":2269},{"name":"吐槽","count":40,"total_count":39582},{"name":"马男波杰克","count":22,"total_count":171},{"name":"2014年8月","count":19,"total_count":475},{"name":"美剧","count":8,"total_count":121},{"name":"日常","count":5,"total_count":395706},{"name":"2010s","count":4,"total_count":5581},{"name":"动画","count":4,"total_count":35475},{"name":"剧情","count":3,"total_count":15879},{"name":"TVA","count":3,"total_count":15421},{"name":"喜剧","count":2,"total_count":34118},{"name":"非日本","count":2,"total_count":173},{"name":"Animation","count":2,"total_count":490},{"name":"季番","count":2,"total_count":8382},{"name":"社会","count":2,"total_count":1472},{"name":"WEB","count":2,"total_count":70992},{"name":"补番","count